{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b3f7c30d-ae34-88ad-8e25-44270f4485c7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:36:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin, how can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi, yes, um, I'm sorry, I was trying to do this on that app, the city one, on my tablet, and it just froze on me, the little wheel going around, and I think I have to shut the whole thing off and restart it, so I thought I'd just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:33:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, phone works just as good. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the drain on our corner. I'm at 25 Howard Street, in the Fifth Ward. The storm drain backs up and the water comes into our basement, and it did it again this weekend, with the nor'easter, Saturday night into Sunday..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Twenty-five Howard... Let me pull that up. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lucille Fiore. F-I-O-R-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fiore, got it. Okay, yeah, I see a note here from last night, a Carmela Fiore?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's my daughter, she called after work, she said she would... I just wanted to make sure somebody really, um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So she's got it down as a repeat backup. Crew's booked to come out tomorrow, Thursday, and a supervisor's supposed to call you back by Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:32-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's what she said. But you see, this is the second time this winter. The first was in December, that big rain in the middle of the month, and we had about two inches down there. The kids' school boxes got wet, the spare refrigerator... And I called then, and they told me a crew would look at the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. I've got that one too, December twentieth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:34:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And they did come, the Monday, they cleaned off the grate, the leaves and all that. But nobody looked at the drain itself, underneath, the way I was told they would. And I don't think cleaning the top did anything, honestly, because this time it was eight inches. Eight. My file boxes, all our papers..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:35:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a lot of water. Okay, so I'm writing... grate cleared December twenty-second... second flood, eight inches... caller doesn't think the grate cleaning fixed it. That about right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it. And what I keep thinking about is the next storm. My husband and I, we're not young, we can't be carrying things up the stairs every time it rains, and if it's eight inches now, what is it next time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there any way the city could put one of those pump trucks on the corner? When the next big one comes? Just to keep it from backing up until somebody fixes it for good..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question, and honestly it's not a call I can make from this desk. What I'll do is flag the whole history for engineering, both floods, the grate only getting cleaned, and put your pump truck question right in the note so the supervisor answers it when he calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Would they call this number? It's the house phone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0107."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five-five-five, oh-one-oh-seven. Got it. And tomorrow the crew should be going under the street this time, not just the grate. That's the point of the visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so. I just... every time the forecast says rain now I don't sleep..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You'll hear from somebody by Friday. If you don't, call me back and ask for Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:36:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you, Kevin. I'll go fight with that tablet now..."
    }
  ],
